Z||000000||Rich86GT||08-27-2001||10:47 PM||||I was cruising down the freeway and was just shifting into 5th when the transmission went into neutral and stayed there.  <P>After dodging a couple cars I got it over to the side of the road.  There were no gears available from the shifter.  The clutch felt normal and the clutch arm on the transaxle was returning properly.  I could move the shift levers on the transaxle with my hands and it felt like there was nothing attached to them in the transmission.  Any ideas??||||reg||5
